        <mxCell id="DUTUmIXobXM5Z29R_gFR-14" value="&lt;div&gt;Consumo de Combustível&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#33ff33&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Fonte: ANP&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;-Diesel&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;-Gasolina&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;-Etanol&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=#33FF33;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-40" y="290" width="160" height="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="DUTUmIXobXM5Z29R_gFR-15" value="" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeColor=#33FF33;" edge="1" parent="1" source="DUTUmIXobXM5Z29R_gFR-14" target="DUTUmIXobXM5Z29R_gFR-1">
          <mxGeometry width="50" height="50" relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="290" y="440" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="340" y="390" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="DUTUmIXobXM5Z29R_gFR-16" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 0, 204); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(251, 251, 251); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;&quot;&gt;ConsumoETANOL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 0, 204); text-align: left;&quot;&gt;ConsumoGASOLINA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 0, 204); text-align: left;&quot;&gt;ConsumoDIESEL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 0, 204); text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="50.16" y="880" width="120" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="DUTUmIXobXM5Z29R_gFR-17" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#ff3333&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;PROBABILIDADE_YEARMOD.m&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Esta função refina os dados de ano modelo para os veículos circulantes de cada categoria.&lt;br&gt;-Automóveis&lt;br&gt;-Comerciais Leves Otto&lt;br&gt;- Comerciais Leves Diesel&lt;br&gt;- Motos&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Pesados - caminhões&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Pesados - ônibus&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Primeiro, é realizada a multiplicação da taxa de sobrevivência (curva de sucateamento) pela quantidade de veículos de cada ano modelo.&lt;br&gt;Segundo, é consolidado em uma unica matriz a quantidade de veículos da frota circulante para cada ano base da estimativa.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Terceiro, é realizada a probabilidade de circulação de cada veiculo de cada ano modelo&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;OBS: Essa função utiliza a função consolidator do MATLAB&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#cc00cc&quot;&gt;OUTPUT:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 0, 204); text-align: left;&quot;&gt;YEARMOD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=#FF3333;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="85.93999999999997" y="1590" width="608.44" height="420" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="DUTUmIXobXM5Z29R_gFR-18" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#ff3333&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Categorizacao_Combustiveis.m&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Esta função organiza em agrupamentos os diferentes tipos de combustíveis de veículos da frota brasileira provenientes do dado de entrada da ANP.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Existem diversos tipos de combustivel: Alcool, Gasolina, Flex, Diesel, GNV, Gasogenio, Eletrico, etc...&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Serão agrupados os tipos de combustivel para os mais comuns, e serão utilizados apenas aqueles movido a Alcool, Gasolina e Diesel&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#cc00cc&quot;&gt;OUTPUT:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#cc00cc&quot;&gt;FUELTYPE&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=#FF3333;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="905.3199999999999" y="2035" width="373.75" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="DUTUmIXobXM5Z29R_gFR-19" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#ff3333&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Consumos_FlexFuel.m&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Esta função realiza a segregação do consumo de Etanol e Gasolina para os veículos flex fuel para cada ano base da estimativa.&lt;br&gt;É necessário o usuário disponibilizar dados de entrada.&lt;br&gt;Esses dados são obtidos nos relatórios anuais da CETESB, que apresenta a proporção para o estado de São Paulo, e essa proporção é reaplicada para o Brasil.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Esses dados devem ser disponibilizados pelo usuário em um arquivo (.xlsx:) para ser reconhecido pela função.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#33ff33&quot;&gt;Fonte:&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;CETESB - Companhia Ambiental do Estado de SP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Arquivo:&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#ffb570&quot;&gt;\INPUT\&lt;/font&gt;ProporçãoVeiculosFLEX.xlsx&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#cc00cc&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#cc00cc&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#cc00cc&quot;&gt;OUTPUT:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 0, 204); text-align: left;&quot;&gt;FUELTYPE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=#FF3333;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="870" y="2595" width="449.38" height="435" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="DUTUmIXobXM5Z29R_gFR-20" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#ff3333&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#ff3333&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#ff3333&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Segregacao_ConsumosCOMB.m&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Dentre os três tipos de combustivel mais utilizados pelos veículos (Etanol, Gasolina e Diesel), deve-se separar a proporção que cada categoria (Leves, Comerciais Leves, Motos e Pesados) consome.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Esta função importa a proporção de combustível (Diesel, Etanol e Gasolina C) consumido para cada categoria, conforme descrito pelo inventario nacional elaborado pelo MMA.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Esses dados devem ser disponibilizados pelo usuário em um arquivo (.xlsx:) para ser reconhecido pela função.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#33ff33&quot;&gt;Fonte:&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;MMA - Ministério do Meio Ambiente&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Arquivo:&amp;nbsp;&lt;font color=&quot;#ffb570&quot;&gt;\INPUT\&lt;/font&gt;ConsumoCategoria_2012.xlsx&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#cc00cc&quot;&gt;OUTPUT:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 0, 204); text-align: left;&quot;&gt;ConsumoETANOL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 0, 204); text-align: left;&quot;&gt;ConsumoGASOLINA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 0, 204); text-align: left;&quot;&gt;ConsumoDIESEL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=#FF3333;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-359.85" y="3000" width="379.85" height="410" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="DUTUmIXobXM5Z29R_gFR-21" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#ff3333&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Substituindo_STRINGcomb.m&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Esta função apenas atribui um numero para cada tipo de combustível&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Dessa forma não é utilizado texto e sim só double&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Exemplo:&lt;br&gt;Alcool - 1&lt;br&gt;Diesel - 2&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;Flex Etanol - 3&lt;br&gt;Flex Gasolina - 4&lt;br&gt;Gasolina - 5&lt;br&gt;GNV - 6&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Outros - 7&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#cc00cc&quot;&gt;OUTPUT:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 0, 204); text-align: left;&quot;&gt;FUELTYPE&lt;br&gt;TiposdeCombustivel&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=#FF3333;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="890" y="3760" width="420" height="430" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="DUTUmIXobXM5Z29R_gFR-22" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#ff3333&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;BRAVES&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=#FF3333;fillColor=#FFCCCC;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-322.4999999999999" y="3610" width="275" height="280" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="DUTUmIXobXM5Z29R_gFR-23" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#ff3333&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;FatorDETERIORACAO5.m&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=#FF3333;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="270" y="4290" width="373.75" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="DUTUmIXobXM5Z29R_gFR-24" value="EQUAÇÃO:&lt;br&gt;Consumo Combustivel = ConsumoANP * %RodobiarioBEN" style="shape=hexagon;perimeter=hexagonPerimeter2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fixedSize=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-332.97" y="1370" width="320" height="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
